⚡ CONCEPTUAL VIVA QUESTIONS (FROM FULL PROGRAM)
❓ What is inheritance in this program?

👉 FruitDetails inherits Fruit properties using extends keyword.

❓ What is constructor chaining?

👉 Calling parent constructor using super().

❓ Why do we use super keyword?

👉 To initialize parent class variables.

❓ What is object in Java?

👉 Instance of a class created using new keyword.

❓ Why is this keyword used?

👉 To differentiate class variables from parameters.

❓ What is method reuse?

👉 Child class using parent method without rewriting it.

❓ What is Scanner class used for?

👉 Taking input from user.

❓ Why use nextLine after nextInt?

👉 To consume leftover newline character.

❓ Difference between this and super?

👉 this = current class
👉 super = parent class

